--
N5008 [temp.param]/14 + [temp.variadic]/5: two independent deduced packs in
a member constructor template (std::pair's piecewise constructor shape).
The deduction-time pack bindings are now recorded on the pseudo-instance
(#deduced_packs) and replayed at final instantiation;
template_mapt::build's single-pack arithmetic is bypassed for n_packs > 1.
second(sizeof...(A1)) checks the deduced arity; a swapped instantiation
would fail to resolve or read t1.v from tuple<>.  (Known residual, kept out
of this test: sizeof...(EMPTY_PACK) inside an arithmetic mem-initializer
expression still mis-evaluates.)  g++/clang++ runtime-verified.
